      "role": "user",
      "content": "thx. i tried to tilt it like u said but i cant really see much in there. it's just this dark, cramped space under the base. is there like any other way to get the water out without having to take the whole thing apart? it feels like there's just a bunch of stuff gunked up in the corners where i can't reach.",
