      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if i want to mess with a screwdriver in there, sounds risky. honestly i feel like there is something weird going on. even when i dry it out, the error comes back like a few hours later even if i haven't used it. it's like there's something hiding in the cracks or something. is it possible for water to just keep appearing out of nowhere in such a small space?",
